{"parentUuid":"cdb577a6-3440-4046-afd9-398b1ab8ada6","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b6785fd-5407-4f1d-b1fa-397a6ca50e91","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"#278 has another fingind: \n\n<pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n### Medium finding\n\n**Location:** `crates/core/src/extractor/factory_props.rs:77`\n\nWhen an imported package type is used only in a factory callback annotation, such as `make('div', (props: ExternalProps) => <div />)`, its props remain unresolved in structural output. The annotation is stored here, but `dependency_types.rs:129–132` scans only `props_type_name` and `props_type_args`, so the dependency declaration is never loaded. Include references from `factory_props` in that scan.\n</pasted_content id=\"5929\">\n"},"uuid":"cf3d3b4f-cdbc-4788-bd42-c89379e08fd2","timestamp":"2026-11-16T06:17:24.426Z","permissionMode":"auto","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","turnOrigin":"human","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":364,"turnIndex":803},"sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf5-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
